{"sections":[{"slug":"E_M-算畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"E_M-算畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"E_M-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"E_M-算畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb E_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴是指</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其颜色为</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的开圆盘</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\mathbb{R}^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的开嵌入</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">运算为不交圆盘的含入</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathbb{E}_M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的颜色的范畴等价于</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sing}M$. <span lang=\"zh\">但是</span> $\\mathbb{E}_M$ <span lang=\"zh\">不能由</span> $\\operatorname{Sing}M$ <span lang=\"zh\">决定</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是与</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的流形结构有关</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">更准确地说</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的切丛</span> $TM$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分类映射</span> $M \\to \\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对任意映射</span> $B \\to \\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">都有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E_B-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_B$-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">详见此页面</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形以及之间的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">构成的</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>,</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其中</span> $\\mathbb{R}^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成的全子范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Top}(n) := \\operatorname{Emb}(\\mathbb{R}^n,\\mathbb{R}^n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意流形</span> $M\\in\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)_{/M}$ <span lang=\"zh\">实际上是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且等价于</span> $\\operatorname{Sing}M$. <span lang=\"zh\">遗忘函子</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)_{/M} \\to \\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于映射</span> $\\operatorname{Sing} M \\to \\mathsf{BTop}(n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的分类映射</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上还有一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记作</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)^\\otimes$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">元运算为</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">个</span> $\\mathbb{R}^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无交并到</span> $\\mathbb{R}^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">接下来定义算畴</span> $\\mathbb E_M$. <span lang=\"zh\">其底层范畴为</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)_{/M}$, <span lang=\"zh\">运算为</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入子流形之间的含入</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n\\sqcup_k \\mathbb{R}^n &amp;&amp;\\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; \\searrow &amp;\\\\\r\n\\mathbb{R}^n &amp; \\to &amp; M.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">注意图中</span> $\\sqcup_k \\mathbb{R}^n \\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为嵌入</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">个圆盘互不相交</span>.)\n<span lang=\"zh\">更严格地说</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span> $\\mathbb E_M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下的拉回</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n\\mathbb E_M &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathsf{BTop}(n)^\\otimes \\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n(\\mathsf{BTop}(n)_{/M})^{\\sqcup} &amp; \\to &amp; (\\mathsf{BTop}(n))^{\\sqcup}.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这里似乎无法用</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">纯</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的语言来描述这个算畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">无可避免地需要来自流形范畴的同伦信息</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/筛余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">筛余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">可构造其中</span> $\\mathbb{E}_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\int_M \\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_M}(\\mathcal O) \\to \\mathcal O,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\int_M \\mathcal A := \\operatorname{colim}_{U\\in (\\mathsf{Disk}_n)_{/M}} \\mathcal A (U).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>“<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>”</h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X \\colon \\operatorname{Sing}M \\to$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ani_pt","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}_{*}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">为函子</span>, $U\\subset M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为开集</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">紧支集截面</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的空间为</span>\n$$\r\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{c}}(U,X) = \\operatorname{colim}_{K\\subset U} \\Gamma(\\operatorname{Sing}M,X) \\times_{\\Gamma(\\operatorname{Sing}(M\\setminus K),X)} *,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $K\\subset U$ <span lang=\"zh\">取遍</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">的紧子集</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{c}}(U,X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $U,X$ <span lang=\"zh\">均有</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">协变</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">函子性</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及函子</span> $X\\colon\\operatorname{Sing}(M) \\to \\mathsf{Ani}_*$, <span lang=\"zh\">可构造</span> $\\mathsf{Ani}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $\\mathbb{E}_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\Omega_M X$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得其颜色</span> $U\\subset M$ ($M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入圆盘</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">处的分量为紧支集截面生象</span> $\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{c}}(U,X)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为取值为带基点生象</span> $(A,a)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的常值函子</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的维数为</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\Omega_M X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在一个圆盘</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的分量等价于</span> $\\Omega^n(A,a)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}